  message: "Promoted P4 todo_soft → P3 todo_hard for v4.1.0 inclusion. Phase 2 of drain plan: dispatch missing from generic-CBV entries (ListView/DetailView/CreateView/UpdateView/DeleteView/TemplateView) — those subclasses never reach the View entry's frozenset because Django's class hierarchy is external to the project. Fix: extend each generic-CBV entry with the View-inherited lifecycle methods (dispatch, setup, http_method_not_allowed, options)."  # cff1
