  message: "Validated via UAT round 03 of hg-uat-v4.1.0 (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_artifacts/hg-uat-v4.1.0/lab-notebook/round-03-WI-nosug-django-transitive-and-dispatch-revalidation/). Verdict: moved. The _VIEW_LIFECYCLE constant added in PR #196 produces 40 dispatch edges on pretix's generic CBVs (vs 0 in v4.0.0). Round 03 ground-truth 5/5 on dispatch overrides. setup/options/http_method_not_allowed/head/trace from the same _VIEW_LIFECYCLE were not separately quantified in the plan (only dispatch was) — recorded as a coverage gap, not a regression."  # 76ba
